# Props / portfolio

## Pattern

- Load GLB → CPU skin if skinned → bind **`prop`** (albedo) → shadow/prepass with **static** depth shaders.
- Drive in-place clips by moving the root; sample `terrain.heightAt` / `normalAt`; damp tilt.

## Pedestals

- Data from `portfolio/projects.json` (+ `scripts/syncPortfolio.mjs` from htmlportfolio). Collision = XZ circle push.
- Arrow footprints: `hitRadius` (detect) vs `surfaceRadius` (plant). Do not use fat max-AABB as plant radius.
- Approach → **text-only** card; **E** opens link; **I** inspects (`input.inspecting`). Antinous corpse **I**-revive is polled first and consumes I.
- Key lights via `SpellLights` only. No project GIF/thumbs under `public/assets/portfolio/` (org logos only).

## Giant

- Patrol → proximity attack clips; **move-lock** while `_attacking` / `_reacting`.
- Melee hits need **contact** in a timed window: front-facing + hand/forearm near player or body-press; then `didHit` + `giant_hit.mp3` → `character.applyHit` / `avatar.playHit`.
- Arrow zones via `playHit(zone)`; headshots = face-only (see combat).
- Every **5th** arrow land → `giant_roar.mp3`. Stuck arrows: `attachToBone`.
- Cannot be killed. **I** within ~7.5 m awards the **Laestrygonians** collectible (once).
- Proximity **metal** health bar (`HealthBars`) — always full; flashes on arrow impact.

## Antinous ([`src/props/antinous.js`](src/props/antinous.js))

- Spawns after **5** sun-aimed shots. Patrol-only; dies at **20** damage (body **+1**, head **+3**). Corpse + **I** revive. Crush before commit.
- Spawn → `antinous_will_not.mp3` + featured subtitle (“Somebody get this beggars out of here”). Proximity terracotta HP bar drains with damage; flashes on hit.

## Sheep ([`src/props/sheep.js`](src/props/sheep.js))

- **4** patrol east of spawn (`~28, −12`). Arrow hit → random `sheep_1..3.mp3`; die after **2** hits (sink then hide).
- `onAllDead` once → Polyphemus spawn. Collision push while alive/sinking.
- **Sheep card:** after **30 s** play time, if **no** sheep killed, **I** near any living sheep → baa + collectible (once). Killing any sheep locks it out.

## Polyphemus / Cyclops ([`src/props/cyclops.js`](src/props/cyclops.js))

- Hidden until sheep flock wiped → `Dive_Down_and_Land_2` then **calm patrol**.
- **Headshot only** starts permanent enrage (chase `Running` + `Charged_Upward_Slash` when close). Body hits = pain + react, no calm return once enraged.
- Melee connects only on near contact (hand/body); triggers player knockdown. Attack starts ~2 m out with a short windup lunge so meshes meet.
- Dies from **5 headshots inside 15s** (rolling queue). Death → `cyclops_at_dead.mp3` + Greek subtitle + corpse → collectible drop (`polyphemus` card).
- Proximity **5-pip** bar = remaining headshots in the window; body hits flash only (no pip loss).

## Health bars ([`src/ui/healthBars.js`](src/ui/healthBars.js))

- Giant / Antinous / Cyclops only. World-projected DOM via `Vector3.ProjectToRef`; track from `main.js` after prop updates.

## Eumaeus + Argos

- West spawn `(-24, 14)`. Eumaeus sits (`Sit_Cross_Legged`) until **I** (gift range) → stand VO `eumaeus_bow.mp3` + subtitle, grant **bow** + Eumaeus card (once), then limp-patrol only (`Limping_Walk_*`, no normal walk).
- Argos follows Eumaeus; **I** → Argos card + bark + particle ascend (gone for session). Inspect hint when near; range ~5 m.
- **I priority:** when both in range, nearer NPC wins (Argos inspect vs Eumaeus gift). After bow, gift is inert so Argos inspect always available if card missing.
- **No bow / no crosshair** until gift. Zeus soft death if either is shot: fullscreen art + `zeus_death.mp3`, **E** respawn at origin, **lose bow**, **keep cards**. Soft aim warn on crosshair while looking at them.
- Shooting **Argos** banishes him for the session (same end state as ascend). Soft respawn never restores him. Eumaeus stays so the bow can be re-gifted.

## Collectible cards ([`src/props/cards/`](src/props/cards/))

- Catalog + `localStorage` collection (`dunes.cards.v1`).
- Death drops: Antinoös / Polyphemus. Inspect: Laestrygonians / Sheep / Argos. Gift: Eumaeus.
- Drop overlay: **F** flip lore, **E** continue. **B** opens card book (browse ←→, flip F, close B).

## Assets

- Models under `public/assets/odyssey/models/` (`sheep.glb`, `cyclops.glb`, `eumaeus.glb`, `argos.glb`, …). Crush before commit.
- Cards: `antinous`, `polyphemus`, `laestrygonians`, `sheep`, `eumaeus`, `argos` under `odyssey/*_card.png`. VO faces: `odyssey/avatars/*.png` (gilded circles). Zeus death: `odyssey/zeus_death.png`.
